:: Farm Upgrades
<<effects>>
<<farm_work_update>>
<<if $farm_work.alex is "admin" or ($farm_work.alex is "clearing" and $farm_stage is 12)>>
	당신은 알렉스 옆에 앉아 농장을 개선할 방법을 살펴본다.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	당신은 책상에 앉아 농장을 개선할 방법을 살펴본다.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<farm_upgrades_current>>
<<farm_upgrades_status>>

<<if ($sexStats.anus.pregnancy.parasiteBirthEvents gte 1 or $sexStats.vagina.pregnancy.parasiteBirthEvents gte 1) and !$farm.parasitebarn and $farm.build isnot "parasites 1">>
	당신이 낳은 여러 생물들이 머릿속에 떠오른다. 농장에는 그들을 돌보는 데 필요한 모든 것이 있다. <span class="blue">아이디어가 떠오른다.</span>
	<br>
	<<ind>><<link [[기생충들을 위한 축사를 짓는다|Farm Upgrades Parasite Barn]]>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if !$alex_greenhouse>>
	근처 쓰레기통에 빨간 잉크로 뒤덮인 구겨진 종이 조각이 있다.
	<br>
	<<ind>><<link [[살펴본다|Farm Upgrades Greenhouse]]>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if _upgrade_count gte 21>>
	<<earnFeat "The Verdant Empire">>
<</if>>
<<if _upgrade_count gte 14>>
	<<earnFeat "The Leading Farmlands">>
<</if>>
<<if _upgrade_count gte 8>>
	<<earnFeat "The Rival Estate">>
<</if>>
<<if _upgrade_count gte 1>>
	<<earnFeat "The Rival Farm">>
<</if>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[떠난다|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farm Upgrades Greenhouse
<<effects>>

당신은 종이를 펼친다. 세부 사항은 줄이 그어져 있지만, 온실 계획서처럼 보인다.

<<if $farm_work.alex is "admin" or ($farm_work.alex is "clearing" and $farm_stage is 12)>>
	<<npc Alex>><<person1>>
	<<if C.npc.Alex.love gte 80>>
		알렉스가 그것을 받아들고 한숨을 쉰다. "온실이라면 내가 관리하기 더 쉬울 거라고 생각했어." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "그냥 취미로 허브랑 꽃을 키우려고. 계획은 다 세웠는데, 시간이 없을 것 같아."
		<br><br>

		고아원 정원에 딱 맞을 것 같다. 이것과 농장 확장을 동시에 지을 수 있을 것이다.
		<br><br>

		<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(700000, "farmUpgrades")>>
			<<link [[Build (<<printprice 700000>>)|Farm Upgrades Greenhouse 2]]>><<set $alex_greenhouse to 1>><<set $alex_greenhouse_timer to 7>><<money -700000 "farmUpgrades">><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			온실을 지을 돈이 충분하지 않다.
			<br>
		<</if>>

		<<link [[뒤로|Farm Upgrades]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		알렉스가 그것을 낚아채고 코웃음 친다. <span class="red">"이건 중요하지 않아."</span> <<he>>【이가】 말하며 다시 구겨버린다. "그냥 시간 낭비하고 있었어."
		<br><br>
		<<He>>【이가】 당신에게 더 편안함을 느끼면 마음을 열지도 모른다.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Farm Upgrades]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<npc Alex>><<person1>>
	<span class="lblue">다음에 여기서 알렉스가 서류 작업을 하고 있을 때 물어볼 수 있을 것이다.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Farm Upgrades]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>



:: Farm Upgrades Greenhouse 2
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>

<<if ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "shy") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "docile"))>>
	"제-제가 뭐 좀 제안해도 될까요?" 당신이 묻는다. "고아원에 있는 제 친구들이 이걸 좋아할 것 같아요. 저희에겐 정원이 있는데—"
<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant"))>>
	"I've got an idea," you say. "The orphanage could really use a greenhouse. Would it be alright if I used your plans—"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "special">>
	"I've got an idea," you say, leaning over the page. "The orphanage could use a greenhouse like this. Let me borrow your plans—"
<<elseif ((_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty") or (_speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel"))>>
	"Got an idea," you say. "I could use your plans for the orphanage. The orphans would actually get some use out of them—"
<<else>>
	"좋은 생각이 있어요." 당신이 말한다. "고아원에 온실이 있으면 좋을 거예요. 당신의 계획을 써도 괜찮을까요—"
<</if>>
<br><br>

"That's a great idea," Alex interrupts, smiling before <<he>> can quite hide it. "Maybe I wasn't wasting my time after all." <<He>> smooths the paper flat and taps a figure near the top.
<br><br>

You make the call, and by the end of it the builders are already arranging to start.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farm Upgrades]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Farm Upgrades Wall 1
<<effects>>

The stone wall surrounding the farm is old, and whole stretches have crumbled away. Repairing the missing sections properly might deter intruders.
<br><br>

<span class="green">레미의 침범을 약간 늦춘다.</span>
<br>
<span class="green">습격 시 공격자들을 약간 늦춘다.</span>
<br>
<span class="gold">Costs <<printprice 300000>>. Express costs <<printprice 520000>>. Premium costs <<printprice 782000>>.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">건설에 일주일이 걸린다.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">프로젝트가 완료될 때까지 농장에 인부들이 있을 것이다.</span>
<br>
<br>

<<if $farm.build>>
	<span class="blue">한 번에 하나의 업그레이드만 진행할 수 있다.</span>
	<br>
<<elseif setup.inflation.canAfford(300000, "farmUpgrades")>>
	<<link [[Build (0:20)|Farm Upgrades Build]]>><<pass 20>><<money -300000 "farmUpgrades">><<set $farm.build to "wall 1">><<set $farm.build_timer to 7>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(520000, "farmUpgrades")>>
		<<link [[Express Build (0:20)|Farm Upgrades Build]]>><<pass 20>><<money -520000 "farmUpgrades">><<set $farm.build to "wall 1">><<set $farm.build_timer to 4>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(780000, "farmUpgrades")>>
		<<link [[Premium Build (0:20)|Farm Upgrades Build]]>><<pass 20>><<money -780000 "farmUpgrades">><<set $farm.build to "wall 1">><<set $farm.build_timer to 2>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[뒤로|Farm Upgrades]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Farm Upgrades Build
<<effects>>

당신은 전화를 건다.
<<if $phase is "net1">>
	A few Amazoom drones buzz over the fields and drop off your new polyester nets.
<<elseif $phase is "net2">>
	A pair of Amazoom drones soon descends with your new nylon nets.
<<elseif $phase is "net3">>
	An Amazoom drone swoops in and drops off your new polyethylene nets.
<<elseif $phase is "net4">>
	An Amazoom-certified pigeon flutters down and leaves behind your new polypropylene nets with absurd dignity.
<<elseif $phase is "tractor1">>
	A car with the Amazoon logo emblazoned on it rattles up the lane towing your 30 HP tractor.
<<elseif $phase is "tractor2">>
	An Amazoom truck soon rolls up with your 80 HP tractor on the back.
<<elseif $phase is "tractor3">>
	An Amazoom helicopter thunders overhead and lowers your 200 HP tractor into the yard.
<<elseif $phase is "plough">>
	A whole cloud of Amazoom drones arrives and deposits your plough attachment in a clatter of metal.
<<elseif $phase is "seed drill">>
	An Amazoom plane roars overhead and airdrops the seed drill attachment onto the field.
<<elseif $phase is "harvester">>
	A knock sounds at the door. By the time you open it, the harvester attachment has been left on the porch with an Amazoom receipt pinned to it.
<<elseif $phase is "loader">>
	An Amazoom dozer soon rumbles up and drops off your loader attachment.
<<else>>
	By the time you hang up, the workers are already making plans to start.
<</if>>
<<set $phase to 0>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Farm Upgrades]]>><</link>>
<br>

